cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these reports, please cite them using the metadata in this file, and cite seastamp, its reference datasets and the Copernicus Marine products they summarise (see references)."
type: dataset
title: "seastamp example report site: sea attributes of Copernicus Marine CTD profiles"
abstract: >-
  A static web site of summary reports, one page per region and product, for
  the CTD (Conductivity, Temperature, Depth) profiles of the Copernicus Marine
  in-situ NRT and CORA products in the Arctic, Baltic and Mediterranean seas,
  after ctddump's cleaning and de-duplication, stamped by seastamp with sea
  attributes such as the distance to the nearest coast and the bathymetric
  depth. Each page gives the rows and unique locations of the stamped file and,
  per stamped attribute, its statistics and bands over locations and rows.
  Generated with seastamp's summary_site.sh; a point-in-time snapshot of the
  data at the date of each release.
authors:
